## 5. Main API & Authentication Specification

### Telegram Mini App Authentication Protocol

The Mini App passes the `X-Telegram-Init-Data` header populated with Telegram's raw initial data string.

1. Parse query-string parameter pairs into key-value map.
2. Extract the `hash` key and remove it from the map.
3. Sort remaining keys alphabetically and join as `key=value\n`.
4. Derive signature key: `secret_key = HMAC-SHA256(key="WebAppData", msg=BOT_TOKEN)`.
5. Calculate hash: `calculated_hash = HMAC-SHA256(key=secret_key, msg=data_check_string)`.
6. Compare `calculated_hash` to extracted `hash` in constant time (`hmac.compare_digest`).
7. Validate `auth_date`: Reject request if `abs(current_timestamp - auth_date) > 86400` (Replay protection).

```
Client (Mini App)                         FastAPI Service                     PostgreSQL / Redis
       |                                         |                                    |
       |--- POST /api/v1/auth/telegram --------->|                                    |
       |    Header: X-Telegram-Init-Data         |                                    |
       |                                         |--- Validate HMAC SHA-256 ----------|
       |                                         |--- Check auth_date <= 24 hours ----|
       |                                         |                                    |
       |                                         |--- Upsert User Record ------------>|
       |                                         |<-- User Entity Returned -----------|
       |                                         |                                    |
       |                                         |--- Issue Bearer JWT (TTL 1h) ----->|
       |<-- 200 OK (Access Token + User Data) ---|                                    |

```

### Key API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Access Level | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/telegram` | Public | Validates `initData`, upserts user, issues JWT. |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/users/me` | Authenticated | Fetches user profile, active role, and subscription status. |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/subscriptions/plans` | Authenticated | Lists currently available subscription plans. |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/payments/checkout` | Authenticated | Creates a transaction with `idempotency_key` and returns payment gateway link/payload. |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/payments/webhook/{provider}` | Gateway IP / Verification | Webhook handler with explicit duplicate verification. |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/admin/analytics` | Admin / Manager | Returns system metrics (MRR, active users, retention). |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/admin/broadcast` | Admin | Enqueues background push notifications to target user segments. |

